# DUNE EXPRESS: the crank gun. Punched from behind it turns on the lawmen;
# it warns with a flash, then fires a burst of three whatever is in the way
# (both guards in its line fall), and its six rounds make two bursts.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 6
cheat law 0 11 6 0 0
cheat law 1 10 6 0 0
cheat pos 13 6
cheat face 0
wait 2
expect gun_ammo == 6
expect gun_friendly == 0
press B
expect gun_friendly == 1
wait 20
expect gun_ammo == 6
wait 30
expect gun_ammo == 3
expect kills == 2
expect alive == 1
wait 200
expect gun_ammo == 3
